      {
        "id": 17163,
        "title": "Operador de igualdade",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aprendemos como criar e armazenar valores, mas como os comparamos?</p><p>Nos jogos, comparamos números em situações como verificar se a pontuação do jogador corresponde à pontuação necessária para desbloquear o próximo nível.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreToUnlock = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145229,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para comparar se dois números são iguais, usamos o <strong>operador de igualdade</strong>, <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"5 === 5\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao comparar, há apenas dois resultados: <code>true</code> ou <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando comparamos os mesmos números com o operador de igualdade, o resultado é <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>3</code> seguido de <code>===</code> e finalmente <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145232,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando comparamos dois números diferentes com o operador de igualdade, o resultado é <code>false</code>.</p><p>Escolha a opção que compara <code>9</code> com <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>9 === 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145233,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que usamos para verificar se dois números são iguais?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145234,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145235,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em qual dessas situações precisaríamos verificar se dois números são iguais?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ao verificar se a saúde de um jogador é <em>exatamente</em> 0 (fim de jogo)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ao verificar se a saúde de um jogador é <em>menor ou igual a</em> 20 (aviso de saúde baixa)</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ao verificar se a saúde de um jogador é <em>exatamente</em> 0 (fim de jogo).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145236,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> e então <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> e então <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> e então <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145237,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifique se o valor de <code>coins</code> é igual a <code>11</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>=</code>, <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione o operador de comparação de igualdade.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba <code>false</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifique se esses números são iguais digitando <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17164,
        "title": "Operador de desigualdade",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145241,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar se um valor em um jogo não é igual a outro valor, usamos o <strong>operador de desigualdade</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos armazenar o resultado de uma comparação com o operador de desigualdade em uma variável.</p><p>Salve a comparação entre <code>playerLives</code> e <code>maxLives</code> na variável <code>result</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLives = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxLives = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = playerLives !== maxLives;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145243,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variáveis podem armazenar o resultado de comparações de igualdade também.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pausedState = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = currentState === pausedState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos comparar valores com variáveis e variáveis com outras variáveis.</p><p>Digite <code>===</code> para comparar o conteúdo das variáveis.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" targetScore = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore === targetScore);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore !== targetScore);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual valor <code>playerHealth</code> deve ter, para que a comparação na variável <code>isFullHealth</code> resulte em <code>false</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isFullHealth = playerHealth === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>78</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>78</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que valor devemos dar à variável <code>coins</code> para armazenar <code>true</code> em <code>hasMaxCoins</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = ? ; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasMaxCoins = coins === \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>67</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145248,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual deve ser o valor de <code>playerScore</code> se quisermos que <code>equal</code> seja <code>true</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScore = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equal = playerScore === highScore;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>80</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145249,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione o operador que faz a comparação ser <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145250,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifique se o <code>ammo</code> do jogador é igual a <code>13</code> e armazene o resultado na variável <code>correctAmmo</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"correctAnswer\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctAmmo = ammo === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(correctAmmo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>===</code> e finalmente <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145251,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifique se o <code>level</code> atual do jogador é igual ao <code>bossLevel</code> digitando <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossLevel = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(level === bossLevel);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifique se o nome do jogador não está vazio digitando <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"55\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nameLength = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" validName = nameLength !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
